setup_ai_what_md:
The Alanbix assistant is a chat players open from the app:

- it answers questions about the LAN from the **info page** (schedule, Wi-Fi, food…);
- it knows the **tournaments**, the next matches and the leaderboard;
- it helps with **technical problems** (ping, ports, a game that will not connect);
- it can **call an organiser** when it does not know the answer;
- it **moderates the public chat** and writes the end-of-tournament summary.

It is optional: everything else in Alanbix works without it.
